- [ ] Any changes to any code should be tested be re-executing the deployment script. If any code changes require makign changes to the deployment script explain those changes and ask for permission to update the script accordingly.
- [ ] If you do make changes to the deployment script: Make sure you think about how those changes will affect any downstream steps and act accordingly.
